{"id":1592,"root":"ثبي","bw":"vby","tr":"th-b-y","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثَبَوتُ لَهُ خَيرًا بَعْدَ خَيرٍ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت له خيرا بعد خير</span> </span>, or <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شَرًّا</span>, <em>I sent him good after good,</em> or <em>evil</em> [after evil]. (TA.) [See also 2.] </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثَبِىٌّ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبى</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبي</span> </span> One <em>who praises men much</em> [<em>while they are living:</em> see 2]. (TA.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثُبَيَّةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبيه</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبية</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثُبَةٌ</span>, of which it is said to be the dim. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أُثْبِيَّةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثُبَةٌ</span>, in two places. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُثَبًّى</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثبى</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثبي</span> </span> Property <em>collected together.</em> (TA.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":1014,"entries":5,"shownEntries":5,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"vby"}